  "description": "Comfort, Power, and Practicality for Every Journey.\n\nThe E11EVEN ELEANOR Step-Thru Electric Bike is designed to make everyday riding more comfortable and enjoyable. Combining a powerful 500W motor, a long-range 48V 15Ah battery, and an easy-access step-thru frame, ELEANOR delivers smooth performance for commuting, leisure rides, and weekend adventures.\n\nBuilt with premium components including hydraulic disc brakes, front suspension, and a durable rear cargo rack, ELEANOR offers the perfect balance of comfort, capability, and everyday convenience.\n\nKey Features\n\n⚡ 500W Powerful Motor\nRide confidently with smooth pedal assistance and speeds up to 28 MPH, making every journey effortless.\n\n🔋 Extended Riding Range\nThe 48V 15Ah battery provides up to 70 miles of range, giving you more freedom between charges.\n\n🚲 Comfortable Step-Thru Frame\nThe low-step aluminum frame allows for easy mounting and dismounting while promoting a relaxed, upright riding position.\n\n📦 Heavy-Duty Rear Rack\nCarry groceries, work essentials, or travel gear with a rear rack supporting up to 100 lbs, while the bike supports a total payload of 383 lbs.\n\n🛡️ Smooth & Stable Ride\nA 60mm suspension fork, 27.5\" × 2.1 tires, and hydraulic disc brakes work together to provide excellent comfort, control, and braking performance.\n\n⚙️ 8-Speed Drivetrain\nThe SGS 8-speed gear system offers smooth shifting and greater flexibility for climbing hills and adapting to different riding conditions.",
